      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "とある花を採ってきてくれねえか？　咲いてる場所は\n教えてやるから、そこに行ってくればいい。\n道中、あぶねえ猛獣も出るかもな？　やられんなよ。\nやられちまったら稽古にならねえからな！",
        "official_en": "I'd appreciate it if you'd pick a certain flower for me.\nI'll tell you where it blooms, but watch out for wild\nanimals along the way. If they eat you, that'll be the\nend of your lessons!",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
