      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "おお……懐かしいな、この香り！\nこいつは母さんが好きだった花だ。ありがとよ。\n殺風景な牢屋生活だが、これで居心地が良くなった。\nただのお使いじゃねえかって？　稽古だ、稽古！",
        "official_en": "Oh, smell that! These are your mother's favorite\nflowers. It's pretty bleak in this cell, but this smell\nreminds me of better times. No, this wasn't just an\nerrand. It was training! Training!",
        "real_en": null
      },
